Imbues your shields with arcane power, dealing [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] arcane damage with each melee strike and [16, 21, 26, 29, 32 (TL1-5; SP 100)] arcane damage when hit.

Your shields radiate with eldritch forces, imbuing you back with [5, 6, 7, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] spellpower and mindpower per tier of your shields (offhand counts for half). Current bonus is 0.

Allows counterstrikes after incomplete blocks and the cooldown of Block is reduced by [0, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage will increase with Spellpower.
